{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-masaar-saro","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"masaar-saro-arada-properties-tilal","about":"Masaar Saro is a luxury collection of villas and townhouses by Arada Developers in Sharjah, the seventh and final phase of the Masaar project. The development is located in the heart of the green belt and is surrounded by beautifully landscaped gardens, creating a tranquil cozy atmosphere for living. Each residence perfectly combines the aesthetics of nature and modern technology to provide convenience, comfort and environmental preservation. Smart Home technology is integrated into each residence, bringing innovation and comfort to everyday life. Apartments are equipped with essential appliances such as stoves, range hoods and washer/dryers.Among the amenities residents enjoy are a swimming pool, fitness club, community center, sports and children's playgrounds, while the park offers plenty of walking and jogging paths, recreational facilities and BBQ and picnic areas. There are cafes, restaurants and supermarkets within walking distance. The complex also boasts an exclusive 5 kilometer forest bike path and an extensive network of forest walks, allowing residents to lead an active and healthy lifestyle.The development's convenient location provides access to major highways and connectivity to other emirates. Tilal Shopping Center, Sharjah Botanical Gardens and Nasma Central Park are just two minutes away, Sharjah International Airport is 16 minutes away and Dubai International Airport is about 21 minutes away.","price":2651000,"title":"Masaar Saro","bitrix":{"id":926,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Masaar Saro","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Masaar Saro","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Arada Developments","project_location":"Tilal City"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/530/images/2023/10/